profile.P1_POTATO.comment=Maximum performance. Disables most effects. Intended for low-end systems.
profile.P2_LOW.comment=Basic shadows, reflections and fog with minimal post-processing.
profile.P3_MEDIUM.comment=Balanced quality and performance. Volumetric clouds, god rays and PBR enabled.
profile.P4_HIGH.comment=High quality visuals with depth of field, cloud shadows and caustics.
profile.P5_ULTRA.comment=Maximum fidelity: ray-traced shadows, detailed clouds and motion blur. Requires a powerful GPU.
profile.P6_ETHER.comment=§dEther§r: the cinematic preset. Everything in Ultra plus color grading, film grain, vignette, stronger vibrance, night sky nebula, constellations and tornado funnels.\nEach preset sets its own values and does not stack on top of the previous one.